{ Start the sandbox with Notepad #rene-wsb-with-notepad

  Using the parameter `-withNotepad` copies the host's `→ Windows/dirs/Windows/System32/notepad_exe` to the sandbox's `→ Windows/dirs/Windows/System32[C:\Windows\System32]` directory so that `notepad` can be run in the sandbox
 (see also → Windows/optional-features/Windows-Sandbox#win-sandbox-no-notepad[No Notepad in Windows Sandbox]).

  gh|ps-module-wsb|/examples/with-notepad.ps1||

  Note: when `-withNotepad` is used, the parameters `-psScript` and `-logonCommand` have no effect.

}
